# tally 2.2.1 (#221, 221.5), L §4.4 l.665 ("an observation that fulfils the movement fixes its day") and E §6.3: the
# matched line of pay_w, dated window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-07) and fulfilled by bank[r1] on 2026-03-06, is on
# 2026-03-06, timing +0 days. tally 2.2 printed the window's first day, timing +1 days (the 2.2 review's p4/cov.tally).
# tally 2.3 (G1, #247): a window that reaches a move's `on` or `at` makes it a hole day (L §4.4 A movement takes a
# day, §5.14): the movement's places are the hole on every day, HOLE-IMPRECISE naming the day; re-stored.
=== cov.tally
model g4_cov
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "G4 review probe: an observation fulfils a window-dated movement; an observed row dated by a window; residuals and check over them."

source card "invented"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

kind buys: transfers

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

place unexplained: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input bank: observed

input pay: money PLN

input w: date

input w2: date

move pay_w: transfers
  on w
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay

move pay_x: transfers
  on w2
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay

version v_card
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 100.00 PLN "c"
  w = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-07) "c"
  w2 = window(2026-03-30, 2026-04-02) "c"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"

version st
  cite card
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-10
  covers konto
  pad konto from unexplained
  stated[konto] = 595.00 PLN at 2026-03-31 end "s"
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-03-06, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to konto amount 100.00 PLN, fulfils: pay_w) "r1"
  bank[r2] = (on: 2026-03-20, kind: buys, leg cash from konto to world amount 5.00 PLN) "r2"

ask v1: bal(konto, 2026-04-05)
ask v2: bal(konto, 2026-04-05) with w2 = 2026-03-31
ask v3: bal(konto, 2026-04-05) with w2 = 2026-04-01
ask v4: residuals konto 2026-03 .. 2026-04
=== expect v4
v4: residuals konto 2026-03 .. 2026-04
  ?: model 100.00 PLN, observed 0.00 PLN, difference -100.00 PLN
    expected but missing pay_x on ?"date within window(2026-03-30, 2026-04-02) not precise enough for the day of pay_x" (w2): model 100.00 PLN
  2026-03 balance: model ?"date within window(2026-03-30, 2026-04-02) not precise enough for the day of pay_x" (w2), observed 595.00 PLN, difference ?"date within window(2026-03-30, 2026-04-02) not precise enough for the day of pay_x" (w2)
    balance konto 2026-03-31 end (padded): booked ?"date within window(2026-03-30, 2026-04-02) not precise enough for the day of pay_x" (w2), stated 595.00 PLN, gap ?"date within window(2026-03-30, 2026-04-02) not precise enough for the day of pay_x" (w2)
  2026-03 unexplained: model 0.00 PLN, observed -5.00 PLN, difference -5.00 PLN
    unexplained bank[r2] on 2026-03-20: observed -5.00 PLN
  2026-03 move pay_w: model 100.00 PLN, observed 100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    matched pay_w on 2026-03-06: model 100.00 PLN, observed 100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN, timing +0 days
  unknown day: w2
  cut 2026-04-20
